{
  "type": "excalidraw",
  "version": 2,
  "source": "https://excalidraw.com",
  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "box-reqs",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 720,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8fafc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text-reqs-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "Requirements",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#0f172a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-reqs-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 620,
      "text": "Functional Reqs:\n- The user will input a link and get a shorter link\n- User can be redirected to that link upon clicking short link\n- User can copy the short link\n- User can create his own short link (if none in database)\n- Idempotent shortening per creator\n\nNon-Functional Reqs:\n- Rapidity and atomicity\n- If user inputs already registered link, return existing shortened link\n- Rate limiting (Bucket4j token bucket)\n- Logs and visit statistics registration\n- Caching frequently used links per user\n- Caching popular websites (Pareto 80/20 rule)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#334155"
    },
    {
      "id": "box-entities",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 720,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8fafc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text-entities-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "Core Entities",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#0f172a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-entities-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 620,
      "text": "Url Entity:\n  - id: Long (Primary Key)\n  - shortUrl: String (unique, 8 chars)\n  - longUrl: String (unique)\n  - visits: Long (default 0)\n  - creator: User (ManyToOne FK)\n  - createdAt: LocalDateTime\n\nUser Entity:\n  - id: Long (Primary Key)\n  - email: String (unique)\n  - urls: List<Url> (OneToMany)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#334155"
    },
    {
      "id": "box-api",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1030,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 720,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8fafc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text-api-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1050,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "API Gateways / Endpoints",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#0f172a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-api-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1050,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 620,
      "text": "POST /\n  Payload: {\n    \"creator\": \"email\" (optional),\n    \"long-url\": \"https://...\"\n  }\n  Returns: { \"short-url\": \"a1b2c3d4\" }\n\nGET /{short_url}\n  If exists in Cache / DB:\n    redirects: HTTP 302 to long_url\n  Else:\n    returns: { error: 404, message: \"not found\" }\n\nGET /{short_url}/stats\n  Payload: { \"email\": \"creator_email\" }\n  Flushes Redis pending visits to DB\n  Returns: Url analytics with total visits",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#334155"
    },
    {
      "id": "box-sysdesign",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 720,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8fafc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text-sysdesign-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "System Architecture & Data Flow",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#0f172a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-sysdesign-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 620,
      "text": "Client <-> Interceptors (RateLimit & Performance) <-> Server\n\nShorten Flow:\n1. User posts long-url\n2. Server checks if user already shortened it\n3. EncodingService generates unique 8-char short key\n4. Stores in MySQL DB & returns short URL to user\n\nRedirection Flow:\n1. User accesses short URL\n2. Server checks Memory (Redis Cache: url:{shortUrl})\n3. If Cache Hit: INCR visits:{shortUrl} & return 302 redirect\n4. If Cache Miss: Query MySQL DB, populate Redis (24h TTL),\n   INCR visits:{shortUrl} & return 302 redirect\n\nHandlerInterceptors:\n- RateLimitInterceptor: Bucket4j token bucket per IP\n- PerformanceInterceptor: Latency tracking",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#334155"
    },
    {
      "id": "box-deepdive",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 2190,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 720,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8fafc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text-deepdive-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2210,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "Deep Dive & Production Optimizations",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#0f172a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-deepdive-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2210,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 620,
      "text": "Encoding Service:\n- UUID / SHA-256 collision-resistant short URL generation\n- Ensures uniqueness via DB index constraints and retry loop\n\nCaching Logic:\n- Spring Data Redis with Lettuce & StringRedisTemplate\n- Caches short-url -> long-url mapping with 24h expiration\n- 80/20 Rule (Pareto Principle): Top 20% URLs handle 80% traffic\n\nVisits Counter Decoupling (Write-Behind):\n- Visits incremented in Redis (visits:{shortUrl})\n- Avoids continuous write locks on relational database\n- Synchronized to MySQL:\n  1) On-demand: when creator fetches stats via /stats (getAndDelete)\n  2) Background cron: VisitsFlushScheduler runs every 60 seconds",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#334155"
    }
  ],
  "appState": {
    "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff",
    "gridSize": 20
  }
}